      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay, cool. Well that definitely helps. I'll quote, give you a quote based on the inventory and box count I'll be able to email it to you as well so you don't need to take any notes. Alrighty, so $72 just wanna check how long this drive will be real quick. I think it's gonna be about 22 and a half hours. Yeah, I'll probably just budget for three, yeah, it's probably gonna be three hours for sure. Okay, alright.",
