      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Alright. So, yeah, for a move like this, we would send out one truck and we would send out two movers our hourly rate for a two man crew on Saturday to September 26th is $206 per hour and it would take effect once they actually get on site. Now we do have a trip fee, it would be a $672 that trip fee will cover the empty truck getting back after the unload. Outside of that, we include everything in the rate. So, we're going to pat and wrap all those furniture items to prevent damages they're all fully insured. So, if anything got damaged, we would be covering that. We can do disassemble reassembly of things like the bed frames, we'll have tools on-hand for that. We don't have credit card fees, we don't have taxes.",
      "name": "Calvin Hughes",
      "time": "2026-09-14T14:19:22.965543",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "5236346109362176"
